<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36414" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">piscārĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		piscis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to fishing</i>
			or <i>fish</i>, <i>fish-</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">copia piscaria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Cas. 2, 8, 65</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">forum piscarium,</span>”
				<i>the fish-market</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Curc. 4, 1, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hamulus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Stich. 2, 1, 17</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">piscārĭus</span></b> ,
				ii, m., <i>a
			fish-monger</i>: nullus in piscariā piscis erat: inter
			piscarios nemo vendebat, Varr. in Perott. in
			Cornucop.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">piscārĭa</span></b> ,
				ae, f., <i>fish-market</i>, Varr. Fragm. 
				v.
				supra
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 50, 16, 17</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
